# Agent scratch files: repro scripts and throwaway dev configs. `*.local`
# alone does not match `foo.local.ts`/`foo.local.mjs`, which is how four of
# them ended up untracked-but-not-ignored and one of them inflated the
# eslint baseline.
*.local.*
